</div></div></div><div class="fe-block fe-block-6b4cc2c66b5c9110d0e0"><div class="sqs-block website-component-block sqs-block-website-component sqs-block-html html-block" data-block-css="[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/9e23cfdc-e869-4f4c-90e3-54bb813542f1_957/website.components.html.styles.css&quot;]" data-block-scripts="[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/9e23cfdc-e869-4f4c-90e3-54bb813542f1_957/website.components.html.visitor.js&quot;]" data-block-type="1337" data-definition-name="website.components.html" data-sqsp-block="text" data-website-component-id="6b4cc2c66b5c9110d0e0" id="block-6b4cc2c66b5c9110d0e0"><div class="sqs-block-content"><div class="sqs-text-block-container">
  
  <div class="sqs-html-content" data-sqsp-text-block-content><h2 style="white-space:pre-wrap;">Will participating in the STARR study cost any money?</h2><p class="" style="white-space:pre-wrap;">Most of the clinic visit medical costs are typically covered by insurance and other funding the clinic has, but some of our&nbsp;families may have uncovered medical expenses. In addition, families may incur travel expenses to and from the clinic. <strong>The STXBP1 Foundation has expanded its&nbsp;Patient Assistance Program for enrolled patients in the study to help cover both medical and travel expenses</strong> <strong>— now up to $3000 / year</strong>. If you need help with incurred costs for the STARR study, you can apply for reimbursement by filling out the <a href="/s/2023-STARR-Travel-Reimbursement-Form.pdf" target="_blank">travel reimbursement form</a> and follow the instructions in the <a href="/s/2025-STARR-Travel-Reimbursement-Policy-30.pdf" target="_blank">travel reimbursement policy</a> and the <a href="/s/2024-STARR-Medical-Expenses-Reimbursement-Policy-v20.pdf" target="_blank">accompanying medical expenses reimbursement policy</a>. Please email <a href="mailto:finance@stxbp1disorders.org?subject=STARR%20Study%20Reimbursement%20Form" target="">finance@stxbp1disorders.org</a> with any questions.</p></div>


  
