  <div class="sqs-html-content" data-sqsp-text-block-content><h2 style="white-space:pre-wrap;"><strong>STARR Ambassadors</strong></h2><p class="sqsrte-large" style="white-space:pre-wrap;"><strong>The STXBP1 Foundation has a team of volunteers ready to assist you with non-medical questions regarding your STARR visit. Need suggestions on good places to eat? Looking for local activities? </strong></p><p class="" style="white-space:pre-wrap;"><strong>STARR Site Ambassadors</strong> is a team of fellow STXBP1 families ready to help others traveling to one of the STARR Natural History Study sites. These volunteers can share tips on lodging, dining, transportation, and local activities to make your visit smoother. Together, we’re making participation easier, more welcoming, and STXBP1 family-focused.</p><p class="sqsrte-large" style="white-space:pre-wrap;"><strong>Fill out our form and we will be in touch!</strong></p></div>


  
